{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_76_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，狄侵衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_76_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，葬陳宣公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_76_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"三、公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯於鹹。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_76_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"兵車之會也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_76_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"四、秋，九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_76_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_76","textTraditional":"五、冬，公子友如齊。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}